# Standalone PEERPoint PWA — no Microsoft env vars required.
#
# Peer chat (Ably Realtime): create a free app at https://ably.com/sign-up , copy an API key.
# The key must allow Subscribe, Publish, History, and Presence on channels matching peerpoint:room:*
# (or use a dev key with full access). Restricted keys that omit this pattern get "denied capability".
VITE_ABLY_KEY=
#
# Optional: expose dev server for phone testing
#   npm run dev
#   npx cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:5173
# Open the printed https URL on your device.
